## Move to the Creative Field

Shortly after, Ramiz relocated to Mexico and shifted into creative work. He adopted the original paternal family name “Adeeb Azar” to honor his roots. Two years later, he published **_Me Encanta México_**, a collection of short stories centered around life in Mexico.

Source:  
- https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/16374556-me-encanta-mexico

In 2008, he released the feature narrative film **_Where or When_**, a project he had been working on since 2003. The film screened at various festivals and received positive attention.

Sources:  
- https://www.imdb.com/name/nm3047791/  
- https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0413481/fullcredits/

During this period he also produced his second feature, **_El Ganador_**.

Source:  
- https://www.imdb.com/title/tt2705058/

