## Controversies and Legal Issues

In 2006, Pour Azar pleaded guilty to felony theft charges related to unresolved financial issues arising from the failure of Pizza Magia and his subsequent bankruptcy. He was sentenced to probation. Authorities initially believed he had absconded, but the matter was later clarified and he was released from probation in 2010.

Source:  
- http://kool.corrections.ky.gov/KOOL/Details/105542

